{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121013","id":4000365376,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ucLtA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121013.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121013","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121013/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121013/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121013/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/07553605e840045c50150291e12bdfe452c44b32","number":121013,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix regression with `_update_layout()` breaking plugins","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117080#issuecomment-4894319802.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nGDScript doesn't handle compatibility methods for virtuals, which means that the change adding an extra argument to `EditorDock._update_layout()` broke plugins that relied on the original single-argument version.\r\n\r\nThis PR creates a new virtual called `_update_layout_and_slot()`, which contains both arguments, while also removing the extra one in `_update_layout()` and marking it as deprecated.\r\n\r\nAnother way of solving this would be to add virtual compatibility support to GDScript, but that's an area I almost never touched, so I would rather leave that to someone else (which I would eternally thank if they did! :slightly_smiling_face:).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","numb